### Create account 1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{"ownerEmail":"alice@test.com"}

### Create account 2
POST http://localhost:8080/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{"ownerEmail":"bob@test.com"}

### Deposit 500 into account 1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/1/deposit
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount":500.00}

### Transfer 100 from 1 to 2 (run this TWICE; balances must change only once)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: txn-001

{"fromAccountId":1,"toAccountId":2,"amount":100.00}

### Overdraw (expect 422)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/2/withdraw
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount":99999.00}

### Balance
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/1

### History
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/1/entries